   in order to participate. If there is a choice, I obviously would pick the
   one that agrees with me.

But like the stock market, if the buyers buy based on price, all the
sellers will converge on the same price for the same insuree.  Modulo
various transaction costs, the price will be the best possible
estimate of future risk, given the information that it is possible to
obtain.  Sellers who attempt to build different price structures
because they find the market's price structure to be socially
undesirable will go out of business.

